<title>USA: DeKalb Genetics may repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>DeKalb Genetics may repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>DEKALB, Ill. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeKalb Genetics Corp said Friday it may resume purchasing shares of Class A and Class B common stock in the open market or privately negotiated transactions pursuant to an outstanding authorization to purchase up to 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>As of March 31, 1997, there were 2.4 million shares of class A stock outstanding and 14.9 million shares of class B stock outstanding.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
